title: "TrustNode"
abstract: "A Solana-like blockchain validator built from scratch in Rust: proof-of-history clock with real sequential verification, Tower BFT fork choice, Sealevel-style parallel execution, Turbine erasure coding, CRDS gossip and JSON-RPC."
